t incidents, so someone should correct it to `payments-worker` (v3.4.0 \u2192 v3.3.0).\n- **`payments-api`:** I did not roll it back. My first rollback attempt was denied, and it still reports v5.1.0 as degraded with an 18% error rate. Its last healthy release was v5.0.0. If it is still failing, it needs a separate decision.", "type": "text"}]}]}